      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"25\" type=\"會\">25 發勝志樂會</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\">1</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<milestone n=\"92\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b21\">0523b21</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b22\">0523b22</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b23\">0523b23</span><cb:juan n=\"092\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"092\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\">2</cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第九十二</cb:jhead>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b24\">0523b24</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b25\">0523b25</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0523002\">〔大〕－【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0523002\">大【大】，〔－〕【明】</span><app n=\"0523002\"><p class=\"lg\">大</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>唐三藏法師菩提流志奉　詔譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b26\">0523b26</span><cb:jhead>發勝志樂會第二十五之二</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b27\">0523b27</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩摩訶薩白佛言：「世尊！初業\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b28\">0523b28</span>菩薩既出家已，未得慧力而欲得者，當捨何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523b29\">0523b29</span>法、當修何法，未生慧力能令出生，已生慧力\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c01\">0523c01</span>能令增長？」</p><p>佛告彌勒菩薩言：「彌勒！初業菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c02\">0523c02</span>薩既出家已，欲令慧力而得增長，當於利養\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c03\">0523c03</span>知其過失，應須捨離。若好憒閙世俗言話，耽\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c04\">0523c04</span>著睡眠廣營眾務，樂諸戲論，如是過失皆應\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c05\">0523c05</span>遠離。是故應捨利養修於少欲，捨諸憒閙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c06\">0523c06</span>樂於寂靜，捨諸世話觀於實義。初夜後夜遠\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c07\">0523c07</span>離睡眠，觀察思惟隨行修習。捨於眾務及諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c08\">0523c08</span>戲論，修出世道慈念眾生。彌勒！初業菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c09\">0523c09</span>既出家已，未得慧力而欲得者，是法應捨、是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c10\">0523c10</span>法應修。何以故？彌勒！彼諸菩薩既出家已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c11\">0523c11</span>未得慧力而欲得者，不捨利養、不修少欲，未\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c12\">0523c12</span>生慧力當令出生，已生慧力能令增長，無有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c13\">0523c13</span>是處。不捨憒閙、不住寂靜，未生慧力當令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c14\">0523c14</span>出生，已生慧力能令增長，亦無是處。不捨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c15\">0523c15</span>世話、不觀實義，未生慧力當令出生，已生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c16\">0523c16</span>慧力能令增長，無有是處。初夜後夜耽著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c17\">0523c17</span>睡眠曾不覺悟，繫念思惟不捨眾務，好諸戲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c18\">0523c18</span>論，於出世道不能修行，於諸眾生不生慈念，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c19\">0523c19</span>未生慧力當令出生，已生慧力能令增長，亦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c20\">0523c20</span>無是處。彌勒！是故菩薩未得慧力而欲得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c21\">0523c21</span>者，應捨諸法當須捨離，應修諸法當須修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c22\">0523c22</span>習。何以故？菩薩智慧從因緣生，若無因緣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c23\">0523c23</span>終不能生，因緣和合爾乃得生。」</p><p>爾時彌勒菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c24\">0523c24</span>薩白佛言：「世尊！云何名為利養中過？若觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c25\">0523c25</span>察時，能令菩薩樂於少欲不生熱惱。」</p><p>佛言：「彌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c26\">0523c26</span>勒！初業菩薩當觀利養生貪欲故，當觀利\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c27\">0523c27</span>養壞失正念生瞋恚故，當觀利養念其得失\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c28\">0523c28</span>生愚癡故，當觀利養能生高下嫉妬心故，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0523c29\">0523c29</span>觀利養於親友家慳悋耽著生誑惑故，當觀\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a01\">0524a01</span>利養成就愛味生諂曲故，當觀利養捨四\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a02\">0524a02</span>聖種無慚愧故，當觀利養一切諸佛所不許\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a03\">0524a03</span>可、數習憍逸生高慢故，當觀利養於勝福\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a04\">0524a04</span>田起於輕慢為魔黨故，當觀利養眾惡根本\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a05\">0524a05</span>諸善壞故，當觀利養多所貪著猶霜雹故，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a06\">0524a06</span>觀利養於親友家瞻候顏色生憂惱故，當觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a07\">0524a07</span>利養愛物損壞憂心亂故，當觀利養於四\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a08\">0524a08</span>念處多所忘失白法羸故，當觀利養於四正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a09\">0524a09</span>勤多有退失、能令一切他論勝故，當觀利養\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a10\">0524a10</span>自言已得神通智慧違背生故，當觀利養先\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a11\">0524a11</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524001\">得後＝後得【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524001\">得後【大】，後得【明】</span><app n=\"0524001\"><p class=\"lg\">得後</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">後得</rdg></app>失怨憎生故，當觀利養互相瞋嫌說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a12\">0524a12</span>其過惡多覺觀故，當觀利養為於活命營諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a13\">0524a13</span>世業計度思惟安樂減故，當觀利養乃至\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a14\">0524a14</span>禪定解脫三昧三摩鉢底心如<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524002\">婬＝媱【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524002\">婬【大】，媱【元】</span><app n=\"0524002\"><p class=\"lg\">婬</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">媱</rdg></app>女能退失\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a15\">0524a15</span>故，當觀利養捨離智斷墮於地獄、餓鬼、畜\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a16\">0524a16</span>生、閻摩羅界諸惡道故，當觀利養與提婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a17\">0524a17</span>達多、烏陀洛迦同於法住墮惡道故。彌勒！初\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a18\">0524a18</span>業菩薩如是觀察利養過失，樂於少欲不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a19\">0524a19</span>生熱惱。何以故？彌勒！少欲菩薩於一切過\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a20\">0524a20</span>皆悉不生，堪為諸佛清淨法器。而不繫屬在\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a21\">0524a21</span>家出家，住於真實最勝意樂，不為卑下亦不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a22\">0524a22</span>驚怖，離諸惡道墮落畏故，無能映蔽捨耽味\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a23\">0524a23</span>故，眾魔境界得解脫故，一切諸佛之所稱讚，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a24\">0524a24</span>諸天及人亦當愛羨。於諸禪定而不染著，住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a25\">0524a25</span>邊際故。其心質直無有諂曲，於五欲中亦不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a26\">0524a26</span>放逸，見其過故。如說修行能住聖種，同梵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a27\">0524a27</span>行者亦當愛樂。彌勒！若有菩薩智慧聰敏，於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a28\">0524a28</span>此功德能如是知，以勝意樂當捨利養，以勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524a29\">0524a29</span>意樂住於少欲，為斷貪愛而發起故。」</p><p>爾時彌\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b01\">0524b01</span>勒菩薩白佛言：「世尊！云何名為憒閙中過？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b02\">0524b02</span>若觀察時，菩薩獨處閑靜不生熱惱。」</p><p>佛言：「彌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b03\">0524b03</span>勒！初業菩薩應當觀察，憒閙過失有二十種。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b04\">0524b04</span>若觀察時，能令菩薩獨處閑靜不生熱惱。彌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b05\">0524b05</span>勒！云何名為樂於憒閙二十種過？一者不護\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b06\">0524b06</span>身業，二者不護語業，三者不護意業，四者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b07\">0524b07</span>多饒貪欲，五者增長愚癡，六者耽著世話，七\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b08\">0524b08</span>者離出世語，八者於非法中尊重修習，九者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b09\">0524b09</span>捨離正法，十者天魔波旬而得其便，十一者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b10\">0524b10</span>於不放逸未曾修習，十二者於放逸行常懷\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b11\">0524b11</span>染著，十三者多諸覺觀，十四者損減多聞，十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b12\">0524b12</span>五者不得禪定，十六者無有智慧，十七者速\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b13\">0524b13</span>疾而得非諸梵行，十八者不愛於佛，十九者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b14\">0524b14</span>不愛於法，二十者不愛於僧。彌勒！是為菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b15\">0524b15</span>薩觀於憒閙二十種過。」</p><p>爾時世尊重說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b16\">0524b16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「捨離諸貪瞋，<caesura/>不住於憒閙，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b17\">0524b17</span><p class=\"lg\">若有專住彼，<caesura/>是過不應作。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b18\">0524b18</span><p class=\"lg\">憍慢及覺觀，<caesura/>皆由憒閙生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b19\">0524b19</span><p class=\"lg\">壞行無戒人，<caesura/>稱歎於憒閙。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b20\">0524b20</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人樂世論，<caesura/>退失第一義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b21\">0524b21</span><p class=\"lg\">放逸多覺觀，<caesura/>是過不應作。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b22\">0524b22</span><p class=\"lg\">比丘捨多聞，<caesura/>言論不<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524003\">如＝知【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524003\">如【大】，知【宮】</span><app n=\"0524003\"><p class=\"lg\">如</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">知</rdg></app>理，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b23\">0524b23</span><p class=\"lg\">損減諸禪定，<caesura/>常思惟世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b24\">0524b24</span><p class=\"lg\">耽著思惟者，<caesura/>何得於寂靜？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b25\">0524b25</span><p class=\"lg\">其心常散逸，<caesura/>永離於正觀。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b26\">0524b26</span><p class=\"lg\">速得非梵行，<caesura/>諠雜無儀撿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b27\">0524b27</span><p class=\"lg\">亦不曾愛佛，<caesura/>及愛於聖眾，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b28\">0524b28</span><p class=\"lg\">棄捨離欲法，<caesura/>耽著非法言。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524b29\">0524b29</span><p class=\"lg\">我<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524004\">常＝甞【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524004\">常【大】，甞【宮】</span><app n=\"0524004\"><p class=\"lg\">常</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">甞</rdg></app>捨千身，<caesura/>支分及頭目，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c01\">0524c01</span><p class=\"lg\">為求無上道，<caesura/>聞法無厭足；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c02\">0524c02</span><p class=\"lg\">是諸非法人，<caesura/>少聞便厭捨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c03\">0524c03</span><p class=\"lg\">我昔作國王，<caesura/>為求四句偈，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c04\">0524c04</span><p class=\"lg\">妻子及財寶，<caesura/>悉皆能施與。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c05\">0524c05</span><p class=\"lg\">何有於智者，<caesura/>而不勤聽法？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c06\">0524c06</span><p class=\"lg\">我<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524005\">甞＝常【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0524005\">甞【大】，常【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0524005\"><p class=\"lg\">甞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">常</rdg></app>捨一切，<caesura/>非法之戲論，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c07\">0524c07</span><p class=\"lg\">為於百千劫，<caesura/>難得解脫故；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c08\">0524c08</span><p class=\"lg\">汝等應欣樂，<caesura/>志求微妙法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c09\">0524c09</span><p class=\"lg\">若樂於解脫，<caesura/>最勝功德者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c10\">0524c10</span><p class=\"lg\">世間諸事業，<caesura/>皆所不應問。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c11\">0524c11</span><p class=\"lg\">衣食無勝利，<caesura/>亦不證涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c12\">0524c12</span><p class=\"lg\">當稱嘆最勝，<caesura/>善來諸比丘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c13\">0524c13</span><p class=\"lg\">應敷座令坐，<caesura/>互說諸法要。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c14\">0524c14</span><p class=\"lg\">人身甚難得，<caesura/>隨分行白法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c15\">0524c15</span><p class=\"lg\">讀誦及禪定，<caesura/>汝應如是問。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c16\">0524c16</span><p class=\"lg\">如來入涅槃，<caesura/>遺法當滅壞，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c17\">0524c17</span><p class=\"lg\">比丘多放逸，<caesura/>樂眾棄閑靜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c18\">0524c18</span><p class=\"lg\">為飲食利養，<caesura/>晝夜談世話。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c19\">0524c19</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人於夢中，<caesura/>驚怖而漂溺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c20\">0524c20</span><p class=\"lg\">自知多毀犯，<caesura/>當墮三惡道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c21\">0524c21</span><p class=\"lg\">應生歡喜心，<caesura/>獨處於閑寂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c22\">0524c22</span><p class=\"lg\">若在阿蘭若，<caesura/>志求無上道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c23\">0524c23</span><p class=\"lg\">不應見人過，<caesura/>自謂最尊勝，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c24\">0524c24</span><p class=\"lg\">憍恣放逸本，<caesura/>莫輕下劣人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c25\">0524c25</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於遺法中，<caesura/>漸次而解脫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c26\">0524c26</span><p class=\"lg\">比丘雖破戒，<caesura/>深信於三寶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c27\">0524c27</span><p class=\"lg\">是則解脫因，<caesura/>不應見其過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c28\">0524c28</span><p class=\"lg\">摧伏貪瞋難，<caesura/>勿驚於放逸，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0524c29\">0524c29</span><p class=\"lg\">餘習法應爾，<caesura/>是故不須說。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a01\">0525a01</span><p class=\"lg\">若清淨比丘，<caesura/>伺他人過失，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a02\">0525a02</span><p class=\"lg\">是最非真實，<caesura/>不名修正法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a03\">0525a03</span><p class=\"lg\">如理修行者，<caesura/>當須自觀察，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a04\">0525a04</span><p class=\"lg\">求道諸比丘，<caesura/>捨離惡言論，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a05\">0525a05</span><p class=\"lg\">常以歡喜心，<caesura/>獨處於閑靜。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a06\">0525a06</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩復白佛言：「希有世尊！耽著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a07\">0525a07</span>憒閙乃有如是無量過惡，退失功德無有利\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a08\">0525a08</span>益，增長煩惱墮諸惡趣遠離白法。何有菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a09\">0525a09</span>求善法者，聞是過失而不樂於獨處閑<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525001\">靜＝寂【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525001\">靜【大】，寂【明】</span><app n=\"0525001\"><p class=\"lg\">靜</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">寂</rdg></app>？」</p><p>爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a10\">0525a10</span>時彌勒菩薩白佛言：「世尊！云何名為世話\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a11\">0525a11</span>中過？若觀察時，菩薩應住決定之義，由觀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a12\">0525a12</span>是義不生熱惱。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a13\">0525a13</span><p>佛言：「彌勒！初業菩薩應當觀察世話過失有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a14\">0525a14</span>二十種。若觀察時，能令菩薩住決定義，由\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a15\">0525a15</span>觀是義不生熱惱。彌勒！云何名為樂於世話\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a16\">0525a16</span>二十種過？一者心生憍恣不敬多聞，二者於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a17\">0525a17</span>諸諍論多起執著，三者失於正念如理作意，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a18\">0525a18</span>四者為所不應身多躁動，五者速疾高下壞\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a19\">0525a19</span>於法忍，六者心常剛強禪定智慧曾不熏修，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a20\">0525a20</span>七者非時而語言論所纏，八者不能堅固證\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a21\">0525a21</span>於聖智，九者不為天龍之所恭敬，十者為辯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a22\">0525a22</span>才者常懷輕賤，十一者為身證者之所呵責，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a23\">0525a23</span>十二者不住正信常懷悔恨，十三者心多疑\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a24\">0525a24</span>惑搖動不安，十四者猶如倡<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525002\">伎＝妓【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525002\">伎【大】，妓【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0525002\"><p class=\"lg\">伎</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">妓</rdg></app>隨逐音聲，十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a25\">0525a25</span>五者染著諸欲隨境流轉，十六者不觀真實\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a26\">0525a26</span>誹謗正法，十七者有所希求常不稱遂，十八\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a27\">0525a27</span>者其心不調為人棄捨，十九者不知法界隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a28\">0525a28</span>順惡友，二十者不了諸根繫屬煩惱。彌勒！是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525a29\">0525a29</span>為菩薩樂於世話二十種過。」</p><p>爾時世尊重說\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b01\">0525b01</span>偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b02\">0525b02</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「憍傲於多聞，<caesura/>執著諸諍論，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b03\">0525b03</span><p class=\"lg\">失念不正知，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b04\">0525b04</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離正思惟，<caesura/>身心不寂靜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b05\">0525b05</span><p class=\"lg\">退失於法忍，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b06\">0525b06</span><p class=\"lg\">其心不調順，<caesura/>遠離奢摩他，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b07\">0525b07</span><p class=\"lg\">及毘鉢舍那，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b08\">0525b08</span><p class=\"lg\">不尊敬師長，<caesura/>愛樂於世論，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b09\">0525b09</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧不堅固，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b10\">0525b10</span><p class=\"lg\">諸天不恭敬，<caesura/>龍神亦復然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b11\">0525b11</span><p class=\"lg\">退失於辯才，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b12\">0525b12</span><p class=\"lg\">聖者常呵責，<caesura/>如是耽著人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b13\">0525b13</span><p class=\"lg\">唐捐於壽命，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b14\">0525b14</span><p class=\"lg\">諸行皆缺減，<caesura/>遠離大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b15\">0525b15</span><p class=\"lg\">命終生憂苦，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b16\">0525b16</span><p class=\"lg\">疑惑心動搖，<caesura/>猶如風吹草，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b17\">0525b17</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧不堅固，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b18\">0525b18</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如倡妓人，<caesura/>讚說他勇健，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b19\">0525b19</span><p class=\"lg\">彼人亦復然，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b20\">0525b20</span><p class=\"lg\">隨逐世語言，<caesura/>染著諸欲境，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b21\">0525b21</span><p class=\"lg\">常行於邪道，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b22\">0525b22</span><p class=\"lg\">希求心不遂，<caesura/>諂曲多諍論，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b23\">0525b23</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離於聖行，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b24\">0525b24</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人得少利，<caesura/>其心常搖動，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b25\">0525b25</span><p class=\"lg\">如猿猴躁擾，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b26\">0525b26</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧多退失，<caesura/>無有覺悟心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b27\">0525b27</span><p class=\"lg\">愚者所攝持，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b28\">0525b28</span><p class=\"lg\">迷惑於眼耳，<caesura/>乃至意亦然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525b29\">0525b29</span><p class=\"lg\">常與煩惱俱，<caesura/>是名世話過。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c01\">0525c01</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人樂世話，<caesura/>盡壽常空過，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c02\">0525c02</span><p class=\"lg\">不如思一義，<caesura/>獲利無有邊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c03\">0525c03</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如甘蔗味，<caesura/>雖不離皮節，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c04\">0525c04</span><p class=\"lg\">亦不從皮節，<caesura/>而得於勝味。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c05\">0525c05</span><p class=\"lg\">皮節如世話，<caesura/>義理猶勝味，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c06\">0525c06</span><p class=\"lg\">是故捨虛言，<caesura/>思惟於實義。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c07\">0525c07</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧諸菩薩，<caesura/>能知世話過，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c08\">0525c08</span><p class=\"lg\">常愛樂思惟，<caesura/>第一義功德。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c09\">0525c09</span><p class=\"lg\">法味及義味，<caesura/>解脫第一味，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c10\">0525c10</span><p class=\"lg\">誰有智慧者，<caesura/>心<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525003\">生不＝不生【元】【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525003\">生不【大】，不生【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0525003\"><p class=\"lg\">生不</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【宮】\">不生</rdg></app>欣樂？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c11\">0525c11</span><p class=\"lg\">是故應棄捨，<caesura/>無利諸言話，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c12\">0525c12</span><p class=\"lg\">常樂勤思惟，<caesura/>殊勝第一義。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c13\">0525c13</span><p class=\"lg\">如是第一法，<caesura/>諸佛所讚歎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c14\">0525c14</span><p class=\"lg\">是故明智人，<caesura/>當樂勤修習。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c15\">0525c15</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩復白佛言：「希有世尊！乃能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c16\">0525c16</span>善說世話過失，思惟勝義利益功德。世尊！何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c17\">0525c17</span>有菩薩求於如來真實智慧，而復樂於虛誑\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c18\">0525c18</span>世話？」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c19\">0525c19</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩而白佛言：「世尊！云何名為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c20\">0525c20</span>睡眠中過？若觀察時，菩薩應當發起精進不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c21\">0525c21</span>生熱惱。」</p><p>佛言：「彌勒！初業菩薩應當觀察睡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c22\">0525c22</span>眠過失有二十種。若觀察時，能令菩薩發起\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c23\">0525c23</span>精進意樂無倦。彌勒！云何名為樂於睡眠二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c24\">0525c24</span>十種過？一者懈怠<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525004\">嬾＝懶【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0525004\">嬾【大】，懶【宮】</span><app n=\"0525004\"><p class=\"lg\">嬾</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">懶</rdg></app>惰，二者身體沈重，三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c25\">0525c25</span>者顏色憔悴，四者增諸疾病，五者火界羸弱，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c26\">0525c26</span>六者食不消化，七者體生瘡疱，八者不勤修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c27\">0525c27</span>習，九者增長愚癡，十者智慧羸劣，十一者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c28\">0525c28</span>皮膚闇濁，十二者非人不敬，十三者為行愚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0525c29\">0525c29</span>鈍，十四者煩惱纏縛，十五者隨眠覆心，十\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a01\">0526a01</span>六者不樂善法，十七者白法減損，十八者行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a02\">0526a02</span>下劣行，十九者憎嫌精進，二十者為人輕賤。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a03\">0526a03</span>彌勒！是為菩薩樂於睡眠二十種過。」</p><p>爾時世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a04\">0526a04</span>尊重說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a05\">0526a05</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「身重無儀撿，<caesura/>懈怠少堪任，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a06\">0526a06</span><p class=\"lg\">顏色無光澤，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a07\">0526a07</span><p class=\"lg\">彼人常病惱，<caesura/>風黃多積集，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a08\">0526a08</span><p class=\"lg\">四大互違反，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a09\">0526a09</span><p class=\"lg\">飲食不消化，<caesura/>身體無光潤，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a10\">0526a10</span><p class=\"lg\">聲<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526001\">嘶＝<g ref=\"#CB00542\"/>【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526001\">嘶【大】，<g ref=\"#CB00542\"/>【元】</span><app n=\"0526001\"><p class=\"lg\">嘶</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\"><g ref=\"#CB00542\"/></rdg></app>不清徹，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a11\">0526a11</span><p class=\"lg\">其身生瘡疱，<caesura/>晝夜常昏睡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a12\">0526a12</span><p class=\"lg\">諸虫生機關，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a13\">0526a13</span><p class=\"lg\">退失於精進，<caesura/>乏少諸財寶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a14\">0526a14</span><p class=\"lg\">多夢無覺悟，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a15\">0526a15</span><p class=\"lg\">癡網常增長，<caesura/>樂著於諸見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a16\">0526a16</span><p class=\"lg\">熾盛難療治，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a17\">0526a17</span><p class=\"lg\">損減<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526002\">諸＝於【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526002\">諸【大】，於【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0526002\"><p class=\"lg\">諸</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">於</rdg></app>智慧，<caesura/>增長於愚癡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a18\">0526a18</span><p class=\"lg\">志意常下劣，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a19\">0526a19</span><p class=\"lg\">彼住阿蘭若，<caesura/>常懷懈怠心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a20\">0526a20</span><p class=\"lg\">非人得其便，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a21\">0526a21</span><p class=\"lg\">蒙憒失正念，<caesura/>諷誦不通利，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a22\">0526a22</span><p class=\"lg\">說法多<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526003\">廢＝癈【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526003\">廢【大】，癈【元】</span><app n=\"0526003\"><p class=\"lg\">廢</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">癈</rdg></app>忘，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a23\">0526a23</span><p class=\"lg\">由癡起迷惑，<caesura/>住於煩惱中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a24\">0526a24</span><p class=\"lg\">其心不安樂，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a25\">0526a25</span><p class=\"lg\">功德皆損減，<caesura/>常生憂悔心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a26\">0526a26</span><p class=\"lg\">增長諸煩惱，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a27\">0526a27</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離諸善友，<caesura/>亦不求正法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a28\">0526a28</span><p class=\"lg\">常行非法中，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526a29\">0526a29</span><p class=\"lg\">不欣求法樂，<caesura/>損減諸功德，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b01\">0526b01</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離於白法，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b02\">0526b02</span><p class=\"lg\">彼人心怯弱，<caesura/>恒少於歡喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b03\">0526b03</span><p class=\"lg\">支分多羸瘦，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b04\">0526b04</span><p class=\"lg\">自知身懈怠，<caesura/>嫉妬精進者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b05\">0526b05</span><p class=\"lg\">樂說其過惡，<caesura/>是樂睡眠過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b06\">0526b06</span><p class=\"lg\">智者了其過，<caesura/>常離於睡眠，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b07\">0526b07</span><p class=\"lg\">愚人增見網，<caesura/>無利損功德。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b08\">0526b08</span><p class=\"lg\">智者常精進，<caesura/>勤修清淨道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b09\">0526b09</span><p class=\"lg\">離苦得安樂，<caesura/>諸佛所稱歎。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b10\">0526b10</span><p class=\"lg\">世間諸<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526004\">伎＝妓【元】，技【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526004\">伎【大】，妓【元】，技【明】</span><app n=\"0526004\"><p class=\"lg\">伎</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">妓</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">技</rdg></app>藝，<caesura/>及出世工巧，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b11\">0526b11</span><p class=\"lg\">皆由精進力，<caesura/>智者應修習。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b12\">0526b12</span><p class=\"lg\">若人趣菩提，<caesura/>了知睡眠過，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b13\">0526b13</span><p class=\"lg\">安住精進<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526005\">力＝中【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526005\">力【大】，中【宮】</span><app n=\"0526005\"><p class=\"lg\">力</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">中</rdg></app>，<caesura/>覺悟生慚愧。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b14\">0526b14</span><p class=\"lg\">是故諸智者，<caesura/>常生精進心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b15\">0526b15</span><p class=\"lg\">捨離於睡眠，<caesura/>守護菩提種。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b16\">0526b16</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩而白佛言：「希有世尊！樂著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b17\">0526b17</span>睡眠乃有如是無量過失。若有聞者，不生憂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b18\">0526b18</span>悔厭離之心、發起精進，當知是人甚大愚癡。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b19\">0526b19</span>若有菩薩為欲志求阿耨多羅三藐三菩提\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b20\">0526b20</span>者，聞說如是真實句義功德利益，於諸善法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b21\">0526b21</span>而生懈怠，不起精進住菩提分，無有是處。」</p><p>爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b22\">0526b22</span>時彌勒菩薩白佛言：「世尊！云何名為眾務\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b23\">0526b23</span>中過？若觀察時，令諸菩薩不營眾務勤修佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b24\">0526b24</span>道。」</p><p>佛言：「彌勒！初業菩薩應當觀察樂營眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b25\">0526b25</span>務二十種過。若觀察時，能令菩薩不營眾務\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b26\">0526b26</span>勤修佛道。彌勒！云何名為二十種過？一<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526006\">我＝者【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526006\">者【CB】【麗-CB】【宮】，我【大】</span><app n=\"0526006\"><p class=\"lg\">者<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0730a17</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">我</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">者</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b27\">0526b27</span>耽著世間下劣之業，二者為諸讀誦修行比\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b28\">0526b28</span>丘之所輕賤，三者亦為勤修禪定比丘之所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526b29\">0526b29</span>呵責，四者心常發起無始生死流轉之業，五\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c01\">0526c01</span>者虛食居士及婆羅門淨心信施，六者於諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c02\">0526c02</span>財物心懷取著，七者常樂廣營世間事務，八\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c03\">0526c03</span>者念其家業常懷憂歎，九者其性<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526007\">佷＝狠【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526007\">佷【大】，狠【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0526007\"><p class=\"lg\">佷</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">狠</rdg></app>戾發言\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c04\">0526c04</span>麁獷，十者心常憶念勤修家業，十一者愛著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c05\">0526c05</span>諸味增長貪欲，十二者無利養處不生歡喜，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c06\">0526c06</span>十三者多生惱害障礙之業，十四者常樂親\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c07\">0526c07</span>近諸優婆塞及優婆夷，十五者但念衣食而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c08\">0526c08</span>度晝夜，十六者數問世間所作事業，十七者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c09\">0526c09</span>常樂發起非法語言，十八者恃營眾務而起\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c10\">0526c10</span>憍慢，十九者<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526008\">但＝每【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526008\">但【大】，每【宮】</span><app n=\"0526008\"><p class=\"lg\">但</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">每</rdg></app>求人過不自觀察，二十者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c11\">0526c11</span>於說法者心懷輕賤。彌勒！是為菩薩樂營眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c12\">0526c12</span>務二十種過。」</p><p>爾時世尊重說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c13\">0526c13</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「安住下劣業，<caesura/>遠離殊勝行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c14\">0526c14</span><p class=\"lg\">退失大利益，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c15\">0526c15</span><p class=\"lg\">樂讀誦比丘，<caesura/>及修禪定者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c16\">0526c16</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆呵責，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c17\">0526c17</span><p class=\"lg\">常行生死業，<caesura/>捨離解脫因，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c18\">0526c18</span><p class=\"lg\">虛受於信施，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c19\">0526c19</span><p class=\"lg\">樂受諸財寶，<caesura/>不得生憂惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c20\">0526c20</span><p class=\"lg\">住於下劣行，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c21\">0526c21</span><p class=\"lg\">是人多愛染，<caesura/>往來婬女家，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c22\">0526c22</span><p class=\"lg\">如鳥入樊<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526009\">龍＝籠【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526009\">籠【CB】【麗-CB】【宮】，龍【大】</span><app n=\"0526009\"><p class=\"lg\">籠<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0730b18</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">龍</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">籠</rdg></app>，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c23\">0526c23</span><p class=\"lg\">常憂歎家業，<caesura/>恒懷熱惱心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c24\">0526c24</span><p class=\"lg\">出言人不信，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c25\">0526c25</span><p class=\"lg\">不受尊者教，<caesura/>違<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526010\">拒＝矩【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0526010\">拒【大】，矩【元】</span><app n=\"0526010\"><p class=\"lg\">拒</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">矩</rdg></app>而輕賤，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c26\">0526c26</span><p class=\"lg\">毀犯清淨戒，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c27\">0526c27</span><p class=\"lg\">其心多憶想，<caesura/>勤營於世業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c28\">0526c28</span><p class=\"lg\">不能修智斷，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0526c29\">0526c29</span><p class=\"lg\">貪心恒熾盛，<caesura/>樂著於諸味，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a01\">0527a01</span><p class=\"lg\">曾無知足心，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a02\">0527a02</span><p class=\"lg\">得利生歡喜，<caesura/>無利便憂惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a03\">0527a03</span><p class=\"lg\">貪悋無仁心，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a04\">0527a04</span><p class=\"lg\">惱害無慈愍，<caesura/>增長諸惡業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a05\">0527a05</span><p class=\"lg\">愛蔓相纏縛，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a06\">0527a06</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離於師長，<caesura/>親近惡知識，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a07\">0527a07</span><p class=\"lg\">擯斥持戒人，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a08\">0527a08</span><p class=\"lg\">晝夜無餘想，<caesura/>唯念求衣食，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a09\">0527a09</span><p class=\"lg\">不樂諸功德，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a10\">0527a10</span><p class=\"lg\">常問世間智，<caesura/>不樂出世言，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a11\">0527a11</span><p class=\"lg\">耽愛於邪說，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a12\">0527a12</span><p class=\"lg\">自恃知眾務，<caesura/>輕慢諸比丘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a13\">0527a13</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如狂醉人，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a14\">0527a14</span><p class=\"lg\">常伺求他短，<caesura/>不自見其過，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a15\">0527a15</span><p class=\"lg\">輕毀有德人，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a16\">0527a16</span><p class=\"lg\">如是愚癡者，<caesura/>無有善方便，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a17\">0527a17</span><p class=\"lg\">輕慢說法者，<caesura/>是名眾務過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a18\">0527a18</span><p class=\"lg\">如是下劣業，<caesura/>具足諸過失，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a19\">0527a19</span><p class=\"lg\">何有智慧人，<caesura/>愛樂而修習？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a20\">0527a20</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨殊勝業，<caesura/>具足諸功德，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a21\">0527a21</span><p class=\"lg\">是故有智人，<caesura/>愛樂常修習。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a22\">0527a22</span><p class=\"lg\">若樂下劣業，<caesura/>智者當呵責，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a23\">0527a23</span><p class=\"lg\">如人捨多財，<caesura/>貪求於少分。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a24\">0527a24</span><p class=\"lg\">是故明智人，<caesura/>當捨下劣業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a25\">0527a25</span><p class=\"lg\">應求勝上法，<caesura/>諸佛常稱歎。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a26\">0527a26</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩而白佛言：「希有世尊！彼諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a27\">0527a27</span>菩薩捨離殊勝精進之業，而乃發起下劣之\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a28\">0527a28</span>事，當知是人甚為少智覺慧微淺。」</p><p>佛告彌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527a29\">0527a29</span>勒菩薩言：「彌勒！我今實言告汝，若有菩薩\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b01\">0527b01</span>不修諸行、不斷煩惱、不習禪誦、不求多聞，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b02\">0527b02</span>我說是人非出家者。彌勒！若有勤修智斷行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b03\">0527b03</span>者、智出生者、智成就者、不作世業營眾務\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b04\">0527b04</span>者，我說是人住如來教。若有菩薩樂作世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b05\">0527b05</span>業營於眾務、為所不應，我說是人住於生死，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b06\">0527b06</span>是故菩薩不應親近。彌勒！若有菩薩多營\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b07\">0527b07</span>眾務，造七寶塔遍滿三千大千世界。如是菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b08\">0527b08</span>薩不能令我而生歡喜，亦非供養恭敬於我。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b09\">0527b09</span>彌勒！若有菩薩於波羅蜜相應之法，乃至\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b10\">0527b10</span>受持一四句偈，讀誦修行為人演說，是人乃\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b11\">0527b11</span>為供養於我。何以故？諸佛菩提從多聞生，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b12\">0527b12</span>從眾務而得生也。彌勒！若有菩薩勤營眾務，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b13\">0527b13</span>令彼讀誦修行演說諸菩薩等營於眾務，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b14\">0527b14</span>知是人增長業障無諸福利。何以故？如是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b15\">0527b15</span>所說三種福業，一切皆從智慧而生。是故彌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b16\">0527b16</span>勒！營事菩薩於彼讀誦修行演說諸菩薩所，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b17\">0527b17</span>不應障礙為作留難；讀誦修行演說菩薩於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b18\">0527b18</span>修禪定諸菩薩所，不應障礙為作留難。彌勒！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b19\">0527b19</span>若一閻浮提營事菩薩，於一讀誦修行演說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b20\">0527b20</span>菩薩之所，應當親近供養承事。若一閻浮提\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b21\">0527b21</span>讀誦修行演說諸菩薩等，於一勤修禪定菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b22\">0527b22</span>薩，亦當親近供養承事。如是善業，如來隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b23\">0527b23</span>喜、如來悅可。若於勤修<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0527001\">智＝習【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0527001\">智【大】，習【宮】</span><app n=\"0527001\"><p class=\"lg\">智</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">習</rdg></app>慧菩薩承事供\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b24\">0527b24</span>養，當獲無量福德之聚。何以故？智慧之業\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b25\">0527b25</span>無上最勝，超過一切三界所行。是故彌勒！若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b26\">0527b26</span>有菩薩發起精進，於智慧中當勤修習。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b27\">0527b27</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩白佛言：「世尊！如來善說初\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b28\">0527b28</span>業菩薩樂於憒閙、世話、睡眠、眾務過失。世尊！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527b29\">0527b29</span>云何名為戲論中過？若觀察<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0527002\">時＋（令諸）【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0527002\">時【大】，時令諸【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0527002\"><p class=\"lg\">時</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">時令諸</rdg></app>，菩薩當得住\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c01\">0527c01</span>於寂靜無諸諍論。」</p><p>佛言：「彌勒！初業菩薩戲論\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c02\">0527c02</span>過失無量無邊，我今略說有二十種。云何名\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c03\">0527c03</span>為二十種過？一者於現在生多諸苦惱，二者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c04\">0527c04</span>增長瞋恚退失忍辱，三者為諸怨對之所惱\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c05\">0527c05</span>害，四者魔及魔民皆生歡喜，五者未生善根\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c06\">0527c06</span>皆悉不生，六者已生善根能令退失，七者增\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c07\">0527c07</span>諸鬪諍怨競之心，八者造作地獄惡趣之業，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c08\">0527c08</span>九者當得醜陋不善之果，十者舌不柔軟言\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c09\">0527c09</span>詞謇澁，十一者所受教法不能憶持，十二者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c10\">0527c10</span>於未聞經聞之不悟，十三者諸善知識皆悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c11\">0527c11</span>捨離，十四者諸惡知識速當值遇，十五者修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c12\">0527c12</span>行於道難得出離，十六者不悅意語數數常\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c13\">0527c13</span>聞，十七者在在所生多諸疑惑，十八者常生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c14\">0527c14</span>難處不聞正法，十九者修行白法多有障礙，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c15\">0527c15</span>二十者於所受用多諸怨嫉。彌勒！是為菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c16\">0527c16</span>耽著戲論二十種過。」</p><p>爾時世尊重說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c17\">0527c17</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「現生常苦惱，<caesura/>離忍多瞋恚，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c18\">0527c18</span><p class=\"lg\">怨讎生害心，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c19\">0527c19</span><p class=\"lg\">魔及魔眷屬，<caesura/>皆生歡喜心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c20\">0527c20</span><p class=\"lg\">喪失諸善法，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c21\">0527c21</span><p class=\"lg\">未生善不生，<caesura/>常住於鬪諍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c22\">0527c22</span><p class=\"lg\">造於惡趣業，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c23\">0527c23</span><p class=\"lg\">身<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0527003\">體＝形【元】【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0527003\">體【大】，形【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0527003\"><p class=\"lg\">體</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【宮】\">形</rdg></app>多醜陋，<caesura/>生於下劣家，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c24\">0527c24</span><p class=\"lg\">發言常謇澁，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c25\">0527c25</span><p class=\"lg\">聞法不能持，<caesura/>或聞不入耳，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c26\">0527c26</span><p class=\"lg\">常離諸善友，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c27\">0527c27</span><p class=\"lg\">值遇惡知識，<caesura/>於道難出離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c28\">0527c28</span><p class=\"lg\">常聞不順語，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0527c29\">0527c29</span><p class=\"lg\">隨彼所生處，<caesura/>常懷疑惑心，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a01\">0528a01</span><p class=\"lg\">於法不能了，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a02\">0528a02</span><p class=\"lg\">常生八難中，<caesura/>遠離無難處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a03\">0528a03</span><p class=\"lg\">具足無利益，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a04\">0528a04</span><p class=\"lg\">於善多障礙，<caesura/>退失正思惟，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a05\">0528a05</span><p class=\"lg\">所受多怨嫉，<caesura/>是名戲論過。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a06\">0528a06</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸過失，<caesura/>皆因戲論生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a07\">0528a07</span><p class=\"lg\">是故有智人，<caesura/>速疾當遠離。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a08\">0528a08</span><p class=\"lg\">如是戲論者，<caesura/>難證大菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a09\">0528a09</span><p class=\"lg\">是故有智人，<caesura/>亦應不親近。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a10\">0528a10</span><p class=\"lg\">戲論諍論處，<caesura/>多起諸煩惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a11\">0528a11</span><p class=\"lg\">智者應遠離，<caesura/>當去百由旬。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a12\">0528a12</span><p class=\"lg\">亦不近於彼，<caesura/>造立諸舍宅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a13\">0528a13</span><p class=\"lg\">是故出家人，<caesura/>不應住諍論。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a14\">0528a14</span><p class=\"lg\">汝等無田宅，<caesura/>妻子及僮僕，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a15\">0528a15</span><p class=\"lg\">乃至榮位等，<caesura/>何緣興諍論？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a16\">0528a16</span><p class=\"lg\">出家住寂靜，<caesura/>身被於法服，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a17\">0528a17</span><p class=\"lg\">諸仙咸敬事，<caesura/>當修忍辱心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a18\">0528a18</span><p class=\"lg\">如是戲論者，<caesura/>增長毒害心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a19\">0528a19</span><p class=\"lg\">當墮於惡趣，<caesura/>是故應修忍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a20\">0528a20</span><p class=\"lg\">囚禁及繫縛，<caesura/>刑害而捶楚，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a21\">0528a21</span><p class=\"lg\">如是等諸苦，<caesura/>皆由諍論生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a22\">0528a22</span><p class=\"lg\">如是戲論者，<caesura/>常遇惡知識，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a23\">0528a23</span><p class=\"lg\">名稱不增長，<caesura/>曾無歡喜心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a24\">0528a24</span><p class=\"lg\">若捨於諍論，<caesura/>無能伺其便，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a25\">0528a25</span><p class=\"lg\">眷屬不乖離，<caesura/>當遇於善友。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a26\">0528a26</span><p class=\"lg\">於乘得清淨，<caesura/>業障盡無餘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a27\">0528a27</span><p class=\"lg\">摧伏於魔軍，<caesura/>勤修忍辱行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a28\">0528a28</span><p class=\"lg\">諍論多諸過，<caesura/>無諍具功德，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528a29\">0528a29</span><p class=\"lg\">若有修行者，<caesura/>當住於忍辱。」</p></lg>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b01\">0528b01</span><p>爾時彌勒菩薩復白佛言：「希有世尊！乃能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b02\">0528b02</span>善說如是過失，令諸菩薩生覺悟心。世尊！於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b03\">0528b03</span>後末世五百歲中，頗有菩薩聞說如是諍論\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b04\">0528b04</span>過失，能生憂悔離煩惱不？」</p><p>佛告彌勒菩薩言：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b05\">0528b05</span>「彌勒！於後末世五百歲中，少有菩薩能生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b06\">0528b06</span>憂悔捨離煩惱。多有菩薩其心剛強不相尊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b07\">0528b07</span>敬，懷增上慢互相是非。聞說如是甚深義趣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b08\">0528b08</span>殊勝功德，雖復受持讀誦演說，由是菩薩業\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b09\">0528b09</span>障深重，不能得生殊勝功德，便於是經疑惑\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b10\">0528b10</span>不信，不復受持為人演說。時魔波旬見是事\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b11\">0528b11</span>已，為誑惑故作比丘像，來到其所<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0528001\">說＝作【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0528001\">說【大】，作【明】</span><app n=\"0528001\"><p class=\"lg\">說</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">作</rdg></app>如是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b12\">0528b12</span>言：『此諸經典皆是世俗善文詞者之所製造，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b13\">0528b13</span>非是如來之所宣說。何以故？此經所說功德\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b14\">0528b14</span>利益汝皆不得。』由魔波旬如是誑惑，於此空\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b15\">0528b15</span>性義利相應甚深契經，心生疑惑起諸諍論，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b16\">0528b16</span>不復受持讀誦演說。彌勒！彼諸愚人不能了\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b17\">0528b17</span>知，由自業故不能<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0528002\">護＝獲【元】【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0528002\">護【大】，獲【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0528002\"><p class=\"lg\">護</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【宮】\">獲</rdg></app>彼殊勝功德，自業消\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b18\">0528b18</span>已決定當得如是功德。」</p><p>爾時彌勒菩薩白\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b19\">0528b19</span>佛言：「世尊！如佛所說，阿彌陀佛極樂世界功\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b20\">0528b20</span>德利益。若有眾生發十種心，隨一一心專\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b21\">0528b21</span>念向於阿彌陀佛，是人命終當得往生彼佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b22\">0528b22</span>世界。世尊！何等名為發十種心？由是心故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b23\">0528b23</span>當得往生彼佛世界。」</p><p>佛告彌勒菩薩言：「彌勒！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b24\">0528b24</span>如是十心，非諸凡愚不善丈夫具煩惱者之\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b25\">0528b25</span>所能發。何等為十？一者於諸眾生起於大慈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b26\">0528b26</span>無損害心，二者於諸眾生起於大悲無逼惱\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b27\">0528b27</span>心，三者於佛正法不惜身命樂守護心，四者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b28\">0528b28</span>於一切法發生勝忍無執著心，五者不貪利\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528b29\">0528b29</span>養恭敬尊重淨意樂心，六者求佛種智於一\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c01\">0528c01</span>切時無忘失心，七者於諸眾生尊重恭敬無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c02\">0528c02</span>下劣心，八者不著世論於菩提分生決定心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c03\">0528c03</span>九者種諸善根無有雜染清淨之心，十者於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c04\">0528c04</span>諸如來捨離諸相起隨念心。彌勒！是名菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c05\">0528c05</span>發十種心。由是心故，當得往生阿彌陀佛極\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c06\">0528c06</span>樂世界。彌勒！若人於此十種心中隨成一心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c07\">0528c07</span>樂欲往生彼佛世界，若不得生無有是處。」</p><p>爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c08\">0528c08</span>時尊者阿難白佛言：「希有世尊！乃能開示\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c09\">0528c09</span>演說如來真實功德，發起菩薩殊勝志樂。世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c10\">0528c10</span>尊！當何名此經！我等云何受持！」</p><p>佛告阿難\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c11\">0528c11</span>言：「此經名為『發起菩薩殊勝志樂』，亦名『彌勒\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c12\">0528c12</span>菩薩所問』，以是名字汝當受持。」</p><p>佛說此經已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c13\">0528c13</span>彌勒菩薩及諸聲聞，一切世間天、人、阿修羅、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c14\">0528c14</span>乾闥婆等，聞佛所說，皆大歡喜，信受奉行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0528c15\">0528c15</span><cb:juan n=\"092\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第九十二</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}